# Converge, CR 207.2c: {3}{G}{U} paid with green, blue and three more green mana spent only two colors (Bot1's Black Lotus
# makes GGG), so the search takes a card of mana value 2 or less: a mana value 3 creature, a land and a mana value 1
# artifact that is no creature (Sol Ring: CR 205.2a, none of the three types) are refused, Balduvian
# Bears (exactly 2) is found, exiled and cast for free as the spell resolves (CR 608.2g, 118.9). It is Bot1's own library
# that is searched: Bot2's Balduvian Bears stay in Bot2's library (CR 701.23).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Bring to Light
Island x3
Balduvian Bears
Alaborn Trooper
Sol Ring
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x7
Balduvian Bears
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Bring to Light.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Alaborn Trooper)
! Bot1.Search(Island)
! Bot1.Search(Sol Ring)
Bot1.Search(Balduvian Bears)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Balduvian Bears.Tapped = false

[Expect]
